      "section": "airlines",
      "rank": 100,
      "title": "Delta pushes Riyadh nonstop launch to March 2027",
      "summary": "Delta Air Lines has delayed the start of its nonstop service to Riyadh, Saudi Arabia, until March 2027, The Points Guy reports. The airline tied the postponement to attacks at the airport in Riyadh. No revised schedule details or booking guidance were provided in the report; travelers holding plans around the route should watch for updates from Delta.",
