      "paragraphs": [],
      "keyPoints": [
        "Delta Air Lines' nonstop Riyadh service is now set to begin in March 2027, per The Points Guy.",
        "The reported reason for the delay is attacks at the airport in Riyadh.",
        "The report does not specify the previously planned launch date or any schedule adjustments for ticketed passengers."
      ],
      "takeaway": "If you were planning travel around Delta's Riyadh route, check your booking directly with Delta for schedule change notices before making connecting plans."
